WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,160
At that time, the school forum broke out

2
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,800
Jiang Mu also discovered the secret of my relationship

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:03,800
Mr. Lu doesn’t think all this

4
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,000
Is it all too coincidental?

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,930
What do you mean, Mr. Lu?

6
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:09,530
Miko was my best friend

7
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:11,530
Although I don't agree with some of his mentality

8
00:00:11,530 --> 00:00:13,730
But I always try to understand him and trust him

9
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:14,730
But I didn't expect

10
00:00:14,730 --> 00:00:15,930
This understanding and trust

11
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:16,930
In the end it will become

12
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:18,730
A knife that looks back at myself

13
00:00:18,730 --> 00:00:19,730
Miko adds fuel to the fire

14
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:21,530
Let my classmates report me online

15
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:23,930
Jiang Mu also forged chat records

16
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:25,930
I haven't exposed any of this.

17
00:00:25,930 --> 00:00:27,330
Because I remember us in my hands

18
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:29,730
the good old days between

19
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:32,130
But I am also an acting student

20
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:33,130
I can't just watch

21
00:00:33,130 --> 00:00:35,730
I was being tricked before I even entered the industry I love.

22
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:38,730
Mr. Lu splashed such a big pot of dirty water

23
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:41,130
I know you are a loyal person

24
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:43,330
That’s why you want to help Miko vent his anger on me

25
00:00:43,330 --> 00:00:45,730
But I really don’t want you to be deceived by Miko

26
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:47,730
He is not as simple as you think
